                    "value": "56,000 customers who enrolled between July 2012 and June 2014; source: MySQL database marketing_campaign_analysis. Age and tenure are measured at 29 June 2014, the last enrolment date. Incomes above the 99th percentile are capped. Segments follow the project brief: High Income = income above 75,000; Young = age under 30; Campaign Responder = accepted the latest campaign; High Web Engagement = more than 5 web visits a month; Family = at least one child; High Spender = total spend above the 90th percentile. Under-served = spend below the median, more than 5 web visits a month and no response to the latest campaign.",
